      "seq": 0,
      "text": "Cool, so here's how you're gonna get there.",
      "slide": null,
      "end_sec": 2.091,
      "line_id": "process_line_0",
      "audio_url": "static/kickoff/spotify/process.mp3",
      "highlight": null,
      "start_sec": 0,
      "speaker_id": "3f8a1c6e-52d7-4e0b-b6a4-0c9d7e2f1a33",
      "audio_status": "segment_level",
      "context_point_id": null
     },
     {
      "seq": 1,
      "text": "I've split it into five stages, and each one ends in something real you hand me.",
      "slide": null,
      "end_sec": 6.592,
      "line_id": "process_line_1",
      "audio_url": "static/kickoff/spotify/process.mp3",
      "highlight": null,
      "start_sec": 2.091,
      "speaker_id": "3f8a1c6e-52d7-4e0b-b6a4-0c9d7e2f1a33",
      "audio_status": "segment_level",
      "context_point_id": null
     },
     {
      "seq": 2,
      "text": "First, you clean the dataset, and that's about fifteen minutes.",
      "slide": null,
      "end_sec": 10.005,
      "line_id": "process_line_2",
      "audio_url": "static/kickoff/spotify/process.mp3",
      "highlight": null,
      "start_sec": 6.592,
      "speaker_id": "3f8a1c6e-52d7-4e0b-b6a4-0c9d7e2f1a33",
      "audio_status": "segment_level",
      "context_point_id": "clean_dataset"
     },
     {
      "seq": 3,
      "text": "You find what's wrong with the export, you get Claude to fix it, and you send me back a clean CSV.",
      "slide": null,
      "end_sec": 15.829,
      "line_id": "process_line_3",
      "audio_url": "static/kickoff/spotify/process.mp3",
      "highlight": null,
      "start_sec": 10.005,
      "speaker_id": "3f8a1c6e-52d7-4e0b-b6a4-0c9d7e2f1a33",
      "audio_status": "segment_level",
      "context_point_id": null
     },
     {
      "seq": 4,
      "text": "Second, you build the revenue model, market by market, and that's the big one, about twenty-five minutes, 'cause that's where you find out how far each knob can really go.",
      "slide": null,
      "end_sec": 25.792,
      "line_id": "process_line_4",
      "audio_url": "static/kickoff/spotify/process.mp3",
      "highlight": null,
      "start_sec": 15.829,
      "speaker_id": "3f8a1c6e-52d7-4e0b-b6a4-0c9d7e2f1a33",
      "audio_status": "segment_level",
      "context_point_id": "revenue_model"
     },
     {
      "seq": 5,
      "text": "Third, you make the recommendation, so that's about fifteen minutes to make the call.",
      "slide": null,
      "end_sec": 30.357,
      "line_id": "process_line_5",
      "audio_url": "static/kickoff/spotify/process.mp3",
      "highlight": null,
      "start_sec": 25.792,
      "speaker_id": "3f8a1c6e-52d7-4e0b-b6a4-0c9d7e2f1a33",
      "audio_status": "segment_level",
      "context_point_id": "make_recommendation"
     },
     {
      "seq": 6,
      "text": "Fourth, you write the pricing memo, another fifteen.",
      "slide": null,
      "end_sec": 33.408,
      "line_id": "process_line_6",
      "audio_url": "static/kickoff/spotify/process.mp3",
      "highlight": null,
      "start_sec": 30.357,
      "speaker_id": "3f8a1c6e-52d7-4e0b-b6a4-0c9d7e2f1a33",
      "audio_status": "segment_level",
      "context_point_id": "pricing_memo"
     },
     {
      "seq": 7,
      "text": "And last, you present it, and that's about twelve.",
      "slide": null,
      "end_sec": 36.096,
      "line_id": "process_line_7",
      "audio_url": "static/kickoff/spotify/process.mp3",
      "highlight": null,
      "start_sec": 33.408,
      "speaker_id": "3f8a1c6e-52d7-4e0b-b6a4-0c9d7e2f1a33",
      "audio_status": "segment_level",
      "context_point_id": "present_it"
     },
     {
      "seq": 8,
      "text": "I'm right there with you the whole way, so if you get stuck, you just ask me.",
      "slide": null,
